# Copy this file to ".env" and paste your key in, to run the AI answers locally.
#
#   copy .env.example .env      (Windows)
#   cp .env.example .env        (Mac)
#
# ".env" is git-ignored, so your key stays on your machine. Never put a key in
# this example file, or in any .html or .js file — those are public.
#
# Get a key at https://console.anthropic.com -> API keys
# and set a monthly spend limit while you are there (Settings -> Limits).

ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
